{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"权"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“权”"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $V$ 是 Lie 代数 $\\mathfrak g$ 的表示, $\\lambda$ 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Cartan子代数","text":"Cartan 子代数"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak h$ 上的线性泛函.</p>\n<p>$V$ 关于<strong>权</strong> (weight) $\\lambda$ 的权空间定义为\n$$\r\nV_\\lambda = \\{ v\\in V \\colon  \\forall H\\in \\mathfrak h, Hv=\\lambda (H) v\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>根</h2>\n<p>若 $V$ 是 $\\mathfrak g$ 的伴随表示, 此时的权称为"},{"Local":{"url":"根","text":"根"}},{"Plain":" (root).</p>\n"}]}}